The MIT license above covers the source code of this package.

The bundled dataset (data/banks.json) is a compilation of factual public
information from the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas (BSP) and its operators —
PESONet ACH Participants (Philippine Clearing House Corporation) and InstaPay
ACH Participants (BancNet) — the PDIC Directory of Insured Universal &
Commercial Banks, and public SWIFT/BIC directories. These facts are not
copyrighted by this project. This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by
BSP, PDIC, PCHC, BancNet, or SWIFT. SWIFT/BIC codes and participation status
change over time — always verify with the bank before initiating a transfer.
